# OpenSPM M14 dev111/dev112 - LAST-NIGHT stable NPC performance capture
#
# Pick a reasonably crowded room whose NPCs remain present. The test aborts if
# num/active/table identity changes during stability checks.
#
# During BOTH capture windows, move Mario steadily in one direction when
# practical (for example hold Right). This lets dev111 compare guest movement
# steps while dev112 classifies NPC-owned dispDraw callbacks.
#
# Non-destructive only: no hide/isolate and no active-bit suppression.

defer speed 1
defer npcs suspend off
defer npcs isolate off
defer npcs freeze off

stable_npcs 2.0 0.20

capture start 01-stable-baseline
status
map
pos
npcs info
npcs list
npcs freeze off
wait 5
npcs info
npcs list
capture stop

stable_npcs 1.5 0.20

capture start 02-stable-npc-logic-frozen
status
map
pos
npcs info
npcs list
npcs freeze on
wait 5
npcs freeze off
npcs info
npcs list
capture stop

stable_npcs 1.5 0.20

status
map
pos
npcs info
npcs list
